## What I changed

In `dubbo-common/.../common/URL.java`, I extracted the duplicated parse-with-default logic from the 12 numeric getter overloads into 6 private static helpers (`toDouble`, `toFloat`, `toLong`, `toInt`, `toShort`, `toByte`):

```java
private static long toLong(String value, long defaultValue) {
    return StringUtils.isEmpty(value) ? defaultValue : Long.parseLong(value);
}
```

Each public getter is now a one-liner delegating to the matching helper, e.g.:

```java
public long getParameter(String key, long defaultValue) {
    return toLong(getParameter(key), defaultValue);
}
public long getMethodParameter(String method, String key, long defaultValue) {
    return toLong(getMethodParameter(method, key), defaultValue);
}
```

The `getParameter(key, ...)` and `getMethodParameter(method, key, ...)` families now share the same parse logic instead of each carrying its own copy.

